ra-\nsiṃha Hall p. 166.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वामन poet, a minister under Jayāpīḍa. Rājataraṅgiṇī\n4, 496. Verses of his are given in Skm. Sbhv.\nHe is quoted by Kṣīrasvāmin, Abhinavagupta, Vardha-\nmāna, by Sāyaṇa (both as a grammarian and a writer\non poetics) in the Dhātuvṛtti, and a host of others:\n Aviśrāntavidyādharavyākaraṇa.\n Kāvyālaṃkārasūtra and vṛtti.\n Kāśikāvṛtti partly.\n Whether the Sūtrapāṭha, Uṇādisūtra, Liṅgasūtra\nbelong to the same Vāmaṇa is by no means\ncertain. Peters. 3, 40^a. 111. He quotes the\nPañjikā and Jainendra.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Upādhinyāyasaṃgraha.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Khādiragṛhyasūtrakārikā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Tājikatantra.\n Tājikasāroddhāra.\n Vāmanajātaka.\n Strījātaka.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Nighaṇṭu. See Vāmananighantu.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वामन of the Vatsa race, father of Vāsudeva, father of\nKāmadeva, father of Hemādri, wrote a Balikathā-\ngāthā. Mentioned in Pariśeṣakhaṇḍa 1, 4.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वामन father of Cakradhara (Yantracintāmaṇi).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Vedastutiṭīkā Kalpalatā.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["वामनः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vAmanaH"]}], "vamanacarya": [{"id": "vAmanaAcArya", "headword": "वामनआचार्य", "headword_slp1": "vAmanaAcArya", "fold": "vamanacarya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "वामन आचार्य son of Anantanārāyaṇa, father of Vara-\ndarāja (Pratihārasūtrabhāṣya etc.). Oxf. 379^b.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vamanacaryakaraYjakavisarvaBOma": [{"id": "vAmanaAcAryakaraYjakavisArvaBOma", "headword": "वामनआचार्यकरञ्जकविसार्वभौम", "headword_slp1": "vAmanaAcAryakaraYjakavisArvaBOma", "fold": "vamanacaryakaraYjakavisarvaBOma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "वामन आचार्य करञ्जकवि सार्वभौम\n Prākṛtacandrikā.\n Prākṛtapiṅgalaṭīkā.",